Hi,

I am wondering where AdGuard Home stores the config for blocked services?

I mean this part:
![Screenshot 2022-10-29 at 23-47-30 AdGuard Home](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/48068660/198853619-4532b522-9584-4889-8702-d78faab1a80b.png)


Context:

I run AdGuard Home in Kubernetes and manage all the configuration with a configmap.

Issue: When I edit the configmap the settings above always get overridden because of the new deployment. I tinkered around and looked inside the pod, AdGuardHome.yaml is stored at /tmp. I cp'ed the old one before I made changes in the blocked services settings but the config does not change. Seems this is not configureable over the configuration file? I checked the wiki but didn't find any parameter for that services.

Any hint?

Thanks

